<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Protection from Good</h1>
<p>Sphere: Protection Sphere
Spell Tier: 3
Class: Dark Knight (guild level 32), Necromancer (guild level 33)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast protection from good &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast protection from good</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>Wards the target against good. Whenever someone of good alignment attacks 
them, monster or player, the target defends better: against blows, with their 
shield, and against spells alike. It doesn't keep anyone from attacking.
</p><p>The better your protection sphere, the longer it lasts: from a minute up to 
several minutes. It doesn't add up on someone who already has it. A dispel 
evil cast at the warded one breaks the ward first. You must be standing. It 
is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection from Evil</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Dispel Evil</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Alignment</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>